        "category": "technique",
        "source": "Qliphothic Bestiary",
        "tags": [],
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>One sleeping or unconscious creature within 12 squares. It rolls vs Resolve (DC 16). Fail: 4d10 psychic damage (Stress), the rest is ruined — no benefit from it, no Soma Break refresh — and until it completes an untwisted night's sleep it rolls twice-keep-worse on Resolve checks, deeply disturbed by what it almost remembers dreaming.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        }
      },
      "effects": [],
